259516440267cc&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/fire","id":32321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzIx","login":"fire","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105510#pullrequestreview-2782459217","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105510","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-04-22T00:18:05Z"},{"id":2796300340,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6mrCg0","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"ed81d23258a3017ff4e783c36dfc99471b767e88","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?u=8069d9b7bc6ab503ce83dfcfa53fd021672aeccf&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","login":"Mickeon","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon"},"body":"Part of what originally confused up on the purpose of this PR is that there's no documented reason for this method to exist.\r\n\r\nWhat I mean is, at a glance, most users will look at both `play` and `play_scheduled`. They will see that the latter has a longer name, longer description, and takes longer to set up. As such, they may stick to `_process()` callbacks, **Timer** nodes, etc. for accurate audio purposes. There's barely any mention, or any examples as to why this should be used over `play()`.\r\n\r\nI have no suggestions about that, but I would heavily recommend to at least provide one.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105510#pullrequestreview-2796300340","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105510","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-04-26T17:57:10Z"},{"id":2800966670,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6m81wO","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"ed81d23258a3017ff4e783c36dfc99471b767e88","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10912951?u=dcfd2f2c1573d2b8ea3ce892143ef9a2bff76164&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/PizzaLovers007","id":10912951,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwOTEyOTUx","login":"PizzaLovers007","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/PizzaLovers007"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105510#pullrequestreview-2800966670","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105510","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2025-04-28T21:14:16Z"},{"id":2800966776,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6m81x4","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"ed81d23258a3017ff4e783c36dfc99471b767e88","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10912951?u=dcfd2f2c1573d2b8ea3ce892143ef9a2bff76164&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/PizzaLovers007","id":10912951,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwOTEyOTUx","login":"PizzaLovers007","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/PizzaLovers007"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105510#pullrequestreview-2800966776","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105510","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2025-04-28T21:14:17Z"},{"id":2800966912,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6m810A","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"ed81d23258a3017ff4e783c36dfc99471b767e88","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10912951?u=dcfd2f2c1573d2b8ea3ce892143ef9a2bff76164&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/PizzaLovers007","id":10912951,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwOTEyOTUx","login":"PizzaLovers007","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/PizzaLovers007"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105510#pullrequestreview-2800966912","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105510","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2025-04-28T21:14:20Z"},{"id":2802830266,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6nD8u6","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"ed81d23258a3017ff4e783c36dfc99471b767e88","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?u=8069d9b7bc6ab503ce83dfcfa53fd021672aeccf&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","login":"Mickeon","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105510#pullrequestreview-2802830266","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105510","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-04-29T10:01:21Z"},{"id":2802838430,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6nD-ue","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?u=8069d9b7bc6ab503ce83dfcfa53fd021672aeccf&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","login":"Mickeon","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon"},"body":"I'm generally questioning an implementation detail. I have not looked much at the prior conversation, so I'm not sure if this has ever been brought up.\r\n\r\nIf `AudioServer.get_absolute_time` is so integral to `AudioStreamPlayer.play_scheduled`, why should it be fetched every time in user code? Why should `play_scheduled` require an _absolute_ time, instead of _relative_ time?\r\nEssentially my suggestion is as follows:\r\n```gdscript\r\n# Before:\r\nvar future_time = AudioServer.get_absolute_time() + 1\r\nplayer1.play_scheduled(future_time)\r\n\r\n# After:\r\nplayer1.play_scheduled(1)\r\n```\r\n\r\nRegarding the precision of these methods, I wonder if https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/81873 would be of any inspiration, or if it would even supersede `AudioServer.get_absolute_time` in some situations?\r\n- See https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/81873","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105510#pullrequestreview-2802838430","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105510","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-04-29T10:40:57Z"},{"id":2804932387,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6nL98j","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10912951?u=dcfd2f2c1573d2b8ea3ce892143ef9a2bff76164&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/PizzaLovers007","id":10912951,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwOTEyOTUx","login":"PizzaLovers007","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/PizzaLovers007"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105510#pullrequestreview-2804932387","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105510","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2025-04-29T20:13:14Z"}]